{
    "title": "DJ Mixer Music: Virtual DJ Mix",
    "description": "DJ Mixer Music: Virtual DJ Mix App is a virtual DJ mixer with equalizer, bass booster, sound effects to make perfect beat music by music mix tool. You can use DJ Mixer Music - Beat Maker App as a standard professional DJ music. With DJ Mixer Music, the small phone instantly transforms into a DJ console. \r\n\r\n\u2753 You are passionate about DJing but don't have an instrument to play\r\n\u2753 Do you want to mix your favorite songs professionally\r\n\u2753 You are a professional DJ but want to improve your DJ skills\r\n>> Come and use it quickly to master these professional functions, make you further away from professional DJs by DJ Mixer Music - Virtual DJ Mix App.\r\n\r\n<b>Reasons to own the DJ Mixer Music - Virtual DJ Mix App: </b>\r\n\ud83d\udc83 You want to create your music for the party.\r\n\ud83d\udc83 You want practice at home before the show.\r\n\ud83d\udc83 You haven't learned DJ operation skills before or don't have expensive DJ equipment.\r\n>> DJ Music Remix can help you quickly get started and operate proficiently like a professional DJ.\r\n\r\nDJ Mixer Music - Virtual DJ Mix App has functions such as a design that simulates the real DJ console, you can slide the control bar, rotate the knob, scrub the disc back and forth like in reality, giving you a vivid and interesting interactive experience.\r\n\r\n<b> Professional DJ Mixer Music </b>\r\n\u2714 With DJ Mixer Music, you can mix music flexibly, remix songs and create dynamic mixes that flow effortlessly.\r\n\u2714 Bass Booster & Equalizer & Volume Booster: precise EQ adjustment buttons.\r\n\u2714 Hot Cues with DJ Music Maker - DJ Music Mixer.\r\n\u2714 Variety of Sample Packs: Drum Sounds, Piano, Hip Hop, Beat Drum, Electro, Kick Sounds, etc.\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83c\udfb6Audio Maker\ud83c\udfb6</b>\r\n\u2714 Import your favorite songs and create playlists for your DJ sets by DJ Mixer Music. Easily mix your favorite music with a real DJ player.\r\n\r\n<b>\u2728Simulate a real DJ console</b>\r\n- DJ Mixer Music - DJ Mix Studio has an intuitive and clear beginner guidance interface, allowing you to quickly understand the basic functions of the DJ controller - Music Maker - Beat Maker.\r\n- Convenient to carry, practice anytime or show to friends.\r\n- Adapted to the size of the phone's operating interface and color buttons\ud83c\udf08.\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83d\udcbfVirtual Turntables</b>\r\nDJ Mixer Music - Virtual DJ Mix Studio - DJ Mixer Studio gets the feel of traditional DJing with virtual turntables that allow you to scratch, mix music, remix songs and blend tracks seamlessly.\r\n\r\n<i>How to use:</i>\r\n- Push the buttons to play sound and start relaxing with DJ Mixer Music - DJ Remix App.\r\n- Rotate disc and play remix.\r\n- Enjoy your own music mixer\r\n\r\nThe FOREGROUND_SERVICE permission ensures the appropriate use of user-facing foreground services. For apps targeting Android 14 and above, you must specify a valid foreground service type for each foreground service used in my app.\r\n\r\nSo, what are you waiting for? Download DJ Mixer Music - Virtual DJ Mix App and start remixing tracks like a pro DJs! DJ Maker will mix styles and create wonderful melodies. Come into the fascinating world of DJ, experience the wonderful feeling of creating music yourself with DJ Mixer Music - Virtual DJ Mix - DJ Remix.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc8cThank you for choosing our app.",
    "descriptionHTML": "DJ Mixer Music: Virtual DJ Mix App is a virtual DJ mixer with equalizer, bass booster, sound effects to make perfect beat music by music mix tool. You can use DJ Mixer Music - Beat Maker App as a standard professional DJ music. With DJ Mixer Music, the small phone instantly transforms into a DJ console. <br><br>\u2753 You are passionate about DJing but don&#39;t have an instrument to play<br>\u2753 Do you want to mix your favorite songs professionally<br>\u2753 You are a professional DJ but want to improve your DJ skills<br>&gt;&gt; Come and use it quickly to master these professional functions, make you further away from professional DJs by DJ Mixer Music - Virtual DJ Mix App.<br><br><b>Reasons to own the DJ Mixer Music - Virtual DJ Mix App: </b><br>\ud83d\udc83 You want to create your music for the party.<br>\ud83d\udc83 You want practice at home before the show.<br>\ud83d\udc83 You haven&#39;t learned DJ operation skills before or don&#39;t have expensive DJ equipment.<br>&gt;&gt; DJ Music Remix can help you quickly get started and operate proficiently like a professional DJ.<br><br>DJ Mixer Music - Virtual DJ Mix App has functions such as a design that simulates the real DJ console, you can slide the control bar, rotate the knob, scrub the disc back and forth like in reality, giving you a vivid and interesting interactive experience.<br><br><b> Professional DJ Mixer Music </b><br>\u2714 With DJ Mixer Music, you can mix music flexibly, remix songs and create dynamic mixes that flow effortlessly.<br>\u2714 Bass Booster &amp; Equalizer &amp; Volume Booster: precise EQ adjustment buttons.<br>\u2714 Hot Cues with DJ Music Maker - DJ Music Mixer.<br>\u2714 Variety of Sample Packs: Drum Sounds, Piano, Hip Hop, Beat Drum, Electro, Kick Sounds, etc.<br><br><b>\ud83c\udfb6Audio Maker\ud83c\udfb6</b><br>\u2714 Import your favorite songs and create playlists for your DJ sets by DJ Mixer Music. Easily mix your favorite music with a real DJ player.<br><br><b>\u2728Simulate a real DJ console</b><br>- DJ Mixer Music - DJ Mix Studio has an intuitive and clear beginner guidance interface, allowing you to quickly understand the basic functions of the DJ controller - Music Maker - Beat Maker.<br>- Convenient to carry, practice anytime or show to friends.<br>- Adapted to the size of the phone&#39;s operating interface and color buttons\ud83c\udf08.<br><br><b>\ud83d\udcbfVirtual Turntables</b><br>DJ Mixer Music - Virtual DJ Mix Studio - DJ Mixer Studio gets the feel of traditional DJing with virtual turntables that allow you to scratch, mix music, remix songs and blend tracks seamlessly.<br><br><i>How to use:</i><br>- Push the buttons to play sound and start relaxing with DJ Mixer Music - DJ Remix App.<br>- Rotate disc and play remix.<br>- Enjoy your own music mixer<br><br>The FOREGROUND_SERVICE permission ensures the appropriate use of user-facing foreground services. For apps targeting Android 14 and above, you must specify a valid foreground service type for each foreground service used in my app.<br><br>So, what are you waiting for? Download DJ Mixer Music - Virtual DJ Mix App and start remixing tracks like a pro DJs! DJ Maker will mix styles and create wonderful melodies. Come into the fascinating world of DJ, experience the wonderful feeling of creating music yourself with DJ Mixer Music - Virtual DJ Mix - DJ Remix.<br><br>\ud83d\udc8cThank you for choosing our app.",
